 "description": "<p>This dataset provides the MATLAB script, coordinate data, and associated figure used to construct and visualize the present-day and idealized valley geometries of Xue Mountain Glacial Cirque No. 2, Taiwan. These materials support the manuscript Three-Dimensional Numerical Modeling of Glacier Flow and U-Shaped Valley Evolution in Subtropical Taiwan.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
